      <a class="btn-call" href="tel:{{ business.phoneHref }}">{% include "svg/phone.njk" %}Call {{ business.phone }}</a>
    </div>
    <ol class="wait-list">
      <li><strong>The lean changed suddenly</strong><span>Especially with cracked or raised soil on the far side of the trunk.</span></li>
      <li><strong>A split runs down the trunk</strong><span>A fresh crack between two main stems can open fully in the next wind.</span></li>
      <li><strong>A limb is hung up overhead</strong><span>Broken branches caught in the canopy over a roof, driveway or play area.</span></li>
      <li><strong>It's already resting on something</strong><span>A house, car, fence or another tree. Don't try to pull it off.</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

